You didn't have to scramble my freaking brains.

25
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:14,200
Our target this time is some murderer named Sansan J, isn't it?

26
00:03:14,200 --> 00:03:16,200
So you were paying attention.

27
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:19,200
Of course. This guy likes to lay low until after dark, right?

28
00:03:19,200 --> 00:03:21,200
Nice try, but we're not sightseeing right now.

29
00:03:21,200 --> 00:03:24,200
We have to gather more information about the city.

30
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:26,200
Ugh, fine.

31
00:03:27,200 --> 00:03:30,200
That's better. Let's see.

32
00:03:30,200 --> 00:03:33,200
Where can we go to find some information?

33
00:03:33,200 --> 00:03:35,200
Oh, sorry.

34
00:03:35,200 --> 00:03:37,200
Hey, hold it, punk.

35
00:03:37,200 --> 00:03:39,200
Problem?

36
00:03:39,200 --> 00:03:43,200
You bet there is. I got a problem with any punk who runs into me like that.

37
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:46,200
Who do you think you're messing with? Maybe you'd like me to show you, huh?

38
00:03:46,200 --> 00:03:50,200
If you spoke more and spit less, maybe I'd be able to understand you.

39
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:52,200
What did Small Fry say?

40
00:03:52,200 --> 00:03:56,200
No problem. If you don't understand, we'll explain it to you.

41
00:03:56,200 --> 00:04:02,200
Do you know who controls this town? The Materazzi. That's who. And don't you forget it.

42
00:04:02,200 --> 00:04:06,200
I couldn't care less about that if I tried.

43
00:04:06,200 --> 00:04:09,200
So quit messing around with these guys. We've got work to do.

44
00:04:09,200 --> 00:04:10,200
Yeah, fine by me.

45
00:04:10,200 --> 00:04:13,200
I don't think so. You're not going anywhere.

46
00:04:13,200 --> 00:04:14,200
Huh?

47
00:04:14,200 --> 00:04:18,200
If you think you can cross the Materazzi and get away with it, you're stupider than you look.

48
00:04:18,200 --> 00:04:20,200
We'll show you what happens to punks.

49
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:25,200
Let him have it.

50
00:04:25,200 --> 00:04:32,200
