Hey, what's your deal, pink hair?

59
00:05:26,420 --> 00:05:29,140
Eat their souls. All of their souls.

60
00:05:29,940 --> 00:05:33,200
No, I can't. I'm not ready to do it yet.

61
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:35,400
Get her.

62
00:05:36,400 --> 00:05:38,780
Hey, you. Did you hear me?

63
00:05:40,060 --> 00:05:42,880
They're not Kishin. Not anywhere close to it.

64
00:05:43,060 --> 00:05:45,020
You listening? I said what's your deal.

65
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:47,100
Yeah, freaking. Who are you talking to anyway?

66
00:05:47,820 --> 00:05:50,540
Snake, snake. Cobra, cobra.

67
00:05:59,180 --> 00:06:02,080
It will be all right. Have faith in yourself.

68
00:06:02,080 --> 00:06:05,840
Crona, you will be a Kishin.

69
00:06:05,840 --> 00:06:22,220
I am a Kishin.

70
00:06:22,220 --> 00:06:27,140
Don't make the mistake of thinking you could just walk into our castle uninvited and walk out again, you dirty punk.

71
00:06:27,140 --> 00:06:37,760
This is a public place, actually. The castle doesn't belong exclusively to you or to anyone else for that matter. Which is why Ragnarok is going to eat you all. Right now.

72
00:06:37,760 --> 00:06:49,480
What's up with that car? It's too loud!

73
00:06:49,480 --> 00:06:57,600
Hey, everybody. I feel like something amusing is happening. The doors here open only one way. They open inward.

74
00:06:57,600 --> 00:07:01,320
The thing yesterday sure was fun, wasn't it?

75
00:07:05,320 --> 00:07:07,360
I don't remember what it was, though.

76
00:07:07,360 --> 00:07:10,540
Well, no matter.

77
00:07:10,540 --> 00:07:15,040
This much I know. My blood is black.

78
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:26,500
Found him. Finally.

79
00:07:28,220 --> 00:07:31,060
More power. More soul.

80
00:07:31,060 --> 00:07:37,060
Listen, you murderous maniac. Sonson J, your soul is mine now. It's over.

81
00:07:37,060 --> 00:08:00,180
That's the last one we need to collect on this trip, right?

82
00:08:00,180 --> 00:08:05,120
Yeah. And swallowing this soul is going to be cooler than all you can eat pasta.

83
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:16,720
I was wondering, do souls taste good? You seem to like them.

84
00:08:16,720 --> 00:08:23,240
Yeah, they're delicious. They don't really have a particular flavor. It's just the way they feel going down, the texture.

85
00:08:23,240 --> 00:08:30,080
Hmm. So how do you think Blackstar and Tsubaki are doing? I wonder if they're having any more luck collecting souls than usual.

86
00:08:30,080 --> 00:08:34,900
I doubt it. They're professional losers when it comes to soul collecting. Permanent zeros.

87
00:08:35,120 --> 00:08:38,120
You feel bad for poor Tsubaki.

88
00:08:38,120 --> 00:08:43,120
Blackstar's energy isn't directed at soul collecting. He's more interested in puffing up his own ego.

89
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:50,720
Anyway, we're done here. Let's go. You can wait down below for me. I'll go get the bike and bring it around.

90
00:08:50,720 --> 00:08:52,120
Hey, soul. Hold on.

91
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:54,120
Hmm? Why? Something wrong?

92
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:57,120
That building.

93
00:08:57,120 --> 00:09:01,120
I seem to remember someone saying we didn't come here to sightsee. Oh, that was you.

94
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:09,120
It's not that. Something else. I sense something. A group of souls all wound up together over there.

95
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:16,120
It's all so noisy. Concentrate. Harder.

96
00:09:16,120 --> 00:09:25,120
They're all in that building I pointed to. I can sense the souls of a weapon and a meister. And then there are 50 or 60 human souls surrounding them.

97
00:09:25,120 --> 00:09:28,120
Wow. You can tell all that from over here?

98
00:09:28,120 --> 00:09:35,120
Yeah. It surprised me, too. I think it looks like the humans in there are those guys from this afternoon.

99
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:38,120
Oh, those idiots again? Why do we care what happens to them?

100
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:46,120
I don't like them any more than you do, soul. But they're still human. They're punks, but it's not like their souls have become quiche and eggs.

101
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:52,120
Let's just forget about them, Maka. It's Saturday night, after all. For all we know, maybe they've just got a little fever going on.

102
00:09:52,120 --> 00:10:01,120
No, soul. Now's not the time for jokes. We're representatives of the academy. If we ignore it and something bad happens, it'll be too late.

103
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:05,120
Okay, okay. You win. We'll check it out.

104
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:12,120
But if we storm in there and it ends up being a bunch of people with Blackstar in the center saying,

105
00:10:12,120 --> 00:10:15,120
Welcome to my big show, I'm gonna cry.

106
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:17,120
I only hope that's all it is.

107
