117
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:34,120
You see? They open one way. Those doors only open inward.

118
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:40,120
What the hell? He's in there all by himself. What happened to his weapon partner?

119
00:11:40,120 --> 00:11:42,120
No, there's no way.

120
00:11:42,120 --> 00:11:43,120
Now what?

121
00:11:43,120 --> 00:11:47,120
Lady Medusa, it looks like two others have arrived.

122
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:51,120
Keep it down, Ragnarok. You need to be quiet now.

123
00:11:51,120 --> 00:11:58,120
I'm reading the souls of a Meister and a weapon. And both of them are directly in front of us. Which means...

124
00:11:59,120 --> 00:12:03,120
That Meister standing there... has a weapon inside his body.

125
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:16,120
I screwed up.

126
00:12:17,120 --> 00:12:30,120
Oh, yeah. Maka isn't even at school right now. All this risk for nothing. The only place to see Maka is here at the academy, so I came. Sure. But coming here means I might run into him.

127
00:12:30,120 --> 00:12:38,120
