128
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:47,120
But don't worry, Maka. Your papa's not going to back down. I will overcome this obstacle. And when I do, you'll know how much I love you. You'll finally understand!

129
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:56,120
But before I do all that, I need to have the lovely school nurse heal my wounded heart and give me courage. Oh, yes.

130
00:12:56,120 --> 00:13:06,120
I've been waiting for you, my angel. Hurry now and heal my heart with your sweet, sweet medical love and kiss my pain away.

131
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:14,120
Hey, there, spirit. I've been looking for you.

132
00:13:15,120 --> 00:13:17,120
Ah-ah! The Stein!

133
00:13:18,120 --> 00:13:22,120
I don't know what you want with me, but all the scars from your experiments have finally disappeared!

134
00:13:22,120 --> 00:13:28,120
I'm not afraid of you anymore, so there! I'm not afraid of anything. How do you like that, Stein?

135
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:33,120
Then, I take it you noticed that I swapped the middle toe from your right foot with the one on your left foot?

136
00:13:34,120 --> 00:13:38,120
Ah! What are you nuts?! How could you do something like that to me?!

137
00:13:41,120 --> 00:13:42,120
Made you look!

138
00:13:42,120 --> 00:13:48,120
You know, that little daughter of yours, Maka? She's growing up quickly, huh?

139
00:13:49,120 --> 00:13:53,120
I have to be honest. When I heard you were getting married, I wasn't so sure about it.

140
00:13:54,120 --> 00:13:58,120
I thought to myself, there's no way this is going to work out.

141
00:13:59,120 --> 00:14:03,120
But then, I watched the two of you together, and you seemed so close that I was reassured.

142
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:13,120
And then, I thought, those two have found a love that is sure to last forever.

143
00:14:24,120 --> 00:14:31,120
Um, yeah, about that. You may not know this yet, but Maka's mother and I, we actually got divorced last month.

144
00:14:31,120 --> 00:14:34,120
It's over between us.

145
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:35,120
I know.

146
00:14:36,120 --> 00:14:39,120
Damn it! I'm gonna kill you, you heartless, backward freak!

147
00:14:39,120 --> 00:14:41,120
Oh, yeah, one other thing.

148
00:14:42,120 --> 00:14:44,120
It seems the demon sword has turned up.

149
00:14:46,120 --> 00:14:47,120
What?

150
00:14:48,120 --> 00:14:50,120
What are you talking about, Maka?

151
00:14:51,120 --> 00:14:53,120
You're telling me there's a weapon inside that dude?

152
00:14:54,120 --> 00:14:56,120
Not for long. It's coming out.

153
00:15:01,120 --> 00:15:02,120
What?

154
00:15:02,120 --> 00:15:03,120
What?

155
00:15:03,120 --> 00:15:04,120
Here we go.

156
00:15:04,120 --> 00:15:04,640
It's so cool,

157
