You should know that the hunting of human souls is strictly forbidden.

178
00:16:24,540 --> 00:16:26,120
Are you students?

179
00:16:26,360 --> 00:16:28,060
I haven't seen you at the academy.

180
00:16:28,620 --> 00:16:30,420
At the where? What academy?

181
00:16:30,800 --> 00:16:33,520
Anyway, she said it was okay to eat the human souls.

182
00:16:33,800 --> 00:16:36,380
I don't see what's wrong with it if she said it was okay.

183
00:16:39,200 --> 00:16:41,780
I'm not very good at talking to girls.

184
00:16:42,260 --> 00:16:43,220
They make me nervous.

185
