Never mind that. Her soul looks tasty.

186
00:16:48,180 --> 00:16:51,880
Meisters and their weapons are not allowed to collect human souls for any reason.

187
00:16:51,880 --> 00:16:54,920
We hunt only the souls that have become Kishan eggs.

188
00:16:55,860 --> 00:16:57,780
Now it's my duty to stop you.

189
00:16:58,040 --> 00:17:00,260
You will not hunt any more humans. You hear me?

190
00:17:00,620 --> 00:17:01,880
Let's get her, Krona.

191
00:17:01,880 --> 00:17:15,340
It turned into a weapon.

192
00:17:15,740 --> 00:17:16,240
A sword.

193
00:17:19,040 --> 00:17:20,360
He's gonna strike from below.

194
00:17:24,240 --> 00:17:25,020
Stop this!

195
00:17:25,020 --> 00:17:28,560
You're going to start poking at me also.

196
00:17:32,280 --> 00:17:33,300
You've got him now!

197
00:17:34,300 --> 00:17:34,900
AHHHHH!

198
00:17:34,900 --> 00:17:50,140
Did you think you could cut him in half?

199
00:17:50,800 --> 00:17:53,500
Oh no. Not with a stroke like that one.

200
00:17:54,960 --> 00:17:56,960
Black? Black blood?

201
00:17:56,960 --> 00:18:00,960
Yes. That's right. My blood is black.

202
00:18:03,840 --> 00:18:06,520
What's up with this guy? His body's way freaky.

203
00:18:06,920 --> 00:18:08,240
I think I have an idea.

204
00:18:08,740 --> 00:18:12,000
I don't know how it's possible, but I think his blood itself is a weapon.

205
00:18:12,620 --> 00:18:17,920
I was able to cut through his skin, but his blood hardened and the blade stopped completely when I hit his blood vessels.

206
00:18:18,860 --> 00:18:21,900
Well, if you're right, then how do you propose we go about beating him?

207
00:18:22,580 --> 00:18:24,460
None of our normal attacks will work.

208
00:18:25,040 --> 00:18:26,840
I'm not even sure which hunter will help.

209
00:18:27,100 --> 00:18:32,120
If only I could shoot my soul wavelength directly at him like Blackstar does, I might be able to do some internal damage.

210
00:18:32,200 --> 00:18:33,960
Otherwise, I have no idea what to do.

211
00:18:35,020 --> 00:18:37,560
Krona, why are you taking it so easy?

212
00:18:37,720 --> 00:18:38,340
Do something.

213
00:18:38,920 --> 00:18:41,340
It's not like the ones before. Those were boys.

214
00:18:41,560 --> 00:18:43,380
She's a girl. I'm no good with girls.

215
00:18:43,500 --> 00:18:45,000
What am I supposed to do with her?

216
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:48,980
How silly.

217
00:18:50,080 --> 00:18:51,680
Kill her, of course.

218
00:18:52,700 --> 00:18:55,700
What's with this guy? And who is he talking to anyway?

219
00:18:56,380 --> 00:18:59,060
Oh, okay. You're saying I can kill the girl?

220
00:18:59,500 --> 00:19:01,140
I didn't realize that.

221
00:19:01,900 --> 00:19:03,960
But maybe I could play with her hair first.

222
00:19:04,240 --> 00:19:05,400
Just for a little while.

223
00:19:05,680 --> 00:19:07,300
The doors here open inward.

224
00:19:07,820 --> 00:19:09,400
They only open one way.

225
00:19:11,200 --> 00:19:11,800
Ragnarok.

226
00:19:11,800 --> 00:19:16,020
Screaming resonance.

227
00:19:16,020 --> 00:19:16,100
Ragnarok.

228
00:19:20,500 --> 00:19:21,520
Go beat.

229
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:33,120
It's coming, Maka. Guard now.

230
00:19:33,120 --> 00:19:33,820
Ragnarok.

231
00:19:39,820 --> 00:19:41,600
Soul! Stop it!

232
00:19:44,020 --> 00:19:46,140
Are you okay, soul? Talk to me.

233
00:19:46,800 --> 00:19:48,980
You don't need to worry about that right now.

234
00:19:49,300 --> 00:19:50,740
I am your weapon partner, Maka.

235
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:53,280
That means I am always prepared to die for my maister.

236
00:19:53,280 --> 00:19:59,000
What do I do now?

237
00:19:59,320 --> 00:20:01,880
